# Secrets & data dumps
#
# A real Supabase dump (Lichess OAuth tokens, emails, bcrypt hashes) was once
# committed to this public repo. These patterns keep local copies untracked —
# `restore_from_backup.sql` in the repo is a placeholder template only.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.bak
*.backup
*.dump
*.dump.sql
*_backup.sql
*-backup.sql
backups/
db_cluster-*
